L548:  p -values are also presented in Appendices D and E.
L549: Figure 4. Network meta-analysis ranking and summary of weighted effect sizes.
L550: Figure 5. Network geometry and number of studies in each comparison. Every intervention was compared to a Control. Weighted effect sizes are presented as SMDs and their corresponding 95%CI.
